  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Three centres, nine rooms",
      "items": [
        "Intent: Think unfiltered (the wall), Define strategically (shelves, glossary, catalogue), Moment of truth (trial, map, plan). Re-staged on modules 1 to 3; the engines do not change",
        "Build: Architect your design, Build the data, Ops manager. Planned on modules 4 and 6",
        "Consume: Market forces, What-if, Feeds. Planned on modules 5 and 6. Questions come from the wall's Watch and Levers lanes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "The company profile is the spine",
      "items": [
        "Every room reads profile.read(plane, viewer) and writes through profile.record with provenance: stated, guessed, unknown, and the document or interview behind it",
        "New sections: cards (the wall) and the governed state per measure (owners, classification, who may see, resolving team, affected, review date)",
        "Restricted areas come from the classification policy; a sealed card or file is a silhouette to everyone outside its list, the admin included"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "One exit, four guards",
      "items": [
        "Counts not rows; the minimiser keeps only what the question needs; names become tokens and the vault stays inside; allowlist and log",
        "Internet off by default per company; connectors and cloud push are switches in the control panel, cloud push needs two named approvers",
        "The egress log holds a hash of what left, never the text; the company admin can read it"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "orange",
      "title": "People decide, agents draft",
      "items": [
        "Humans: put a card on the wall, drag to a cluster or shelf, say 'mine' to a measure, settle an ambiguity, accept a risk, sign",
        "Agents: read every document, ask the four questions, cluster and colour, draft definitions and governed state, run the trial, draft the plan, raise at most three questions per person",
        "About 30 human decisions and 10 working days from first card to signed gap report (target)"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Building it",
      "items": [
        "Spec: docs/specs/INTENT-CENTRE-SPEC.md. Plan: docs/specs/INTENT-CENTRE-BUILD-PLAN.md, packages IC-0 to IC-6",
        "A reasoning model orchestrates and reviews gate packages; small models build. tools/route_task.py picks the builder tier and review level per subtask under code rules",
        "Graft first for every builder: skeleton, callers --depth all before any multi-file change"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Not built, said plainly",
      "items": [
        "The wall and the shelves as screens; the governed-state fields; centre switches; the control panel screen",
        "Build and Consume centres entirely",
        "SSO and SCIM, encryption at rest beyond the OS, a retention clock, a packaged customer install, independent penetration testing"
      ]
    }
  ]
